OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers will
OL,6,Fcontinue overnight, with outbreaks
OL,7,Fbecoming frequent and heavy at times,
OL,8,Fbringing hail and the risk of
OL,9,Fthunderstorms and perhaps turning
OL,10,Fwintry. Gale north to northwest winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FAnother day of blustery
OL,13,Fshowers, these wintry over high ground
OL,14,Fwith early hail and the risk
OL,15,Fthunderstorms. The gales will soon
OL,16,Fease down but strong winds continue
OL,17,Fthrough the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
